    <briefdescription>
<para>Performance tracker for prompt templates. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Tracks and aggregates performance metrics for prompts:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Records execution results (success/failure, latency)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Collects user feedback</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Identifies low-performing prompts</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Provides data for optimization decisions</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread-safe for concurrent metric recording. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
